        <mxCell id="legendtext" value="Icons are the real AWS4 icon set bundled in draw.io, plus the actual GitHub logo (embedded, from simple-icons). Note: Target Group boxes use plain styling, not an AWS icon — AWS's official set does include a Target Group pictogram, but I could not verify the exact internal draw.io name for it; search &quot;target group&quot; in draw.io's own shape panel (left sidebar, AWS4 &gt; Networking) to drag the real one on if you want it." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;fontColor=#888780;" vertex="1" parent="1">
